<dc:creator><![CDATA[Paul Lukas]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 12:12:07 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/69bafdee-0f93-4b58-9a2c-19976391530a_2109x1278.jpeg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><em><strong>Note: </strong>This post is not paywalled. Enjoy! &#8212; Paul</em></p><div><hr></div><p>Hello! Last month I <a href="https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/can-you-design-a-new-inconspicuous">announced</a> an Inconspicuous Consumption T-shirt challenge. Just to refresh your memory, here&#8217;s how I laid it out:</p><div class="callout-block" data-callout="true"><p>Lately I&#8217;ve been thinking a bit about Inconspicuous Consumption&#8217;s shorthand abbreviation &#8212; IC. If you say it out loud, it sounds like &#8220;I see.&#8221; That feels right, because Inconspicuous Consumption is often about seeing small details, seeing things that other people miss, the surprise of discovery, and so on. You see? IC!</p><p>I&#8217;ve been thinking that the resonance between &#8220;IC&#8221; and &#8220;I see&#8221; might make the basis for a good logo or T-shirt. For a while I tinkered with a lowercase &#8220;i&#8221; dotted with an eyeball, like this:</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2IXB!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2abfabc4-f54a-4b8e-83ff-29ee108ce6b3_2934x1719.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2IXB!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2abfabc4-f54a-4b8e-83ff-29ee108ce6b3_2934x1719.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2IXB!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2abfabc4-f54a-4b8e-83ff-29ee108ce6b3_2934x1719.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2IXB!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2abfabc4-f54a-4b8e-83ff-29ee108ce6b3_2934x1719.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2IXB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2abfabc4-f54a-4b8e-83ff-29ee108ce6b3_2934x1719.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2IXB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2abfabc4-f54a-4b8e-83ff-29ee108ce6b3_2934x1719.jpeg" width="491" height="287.65315934065933" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2abfabc4-f54a-4b8e-83ff-29ee108ce6b3_2934x1719.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:853,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:491,&quot;bytes&quot;:1341457,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.inconspicuous.info/i/200453779?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2abfabc4-f54a-4b8e-83ff-29ee108ce6b3_2934x1719.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" title="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2IXB!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2abfabc4-f54a-4b8e-83ff-29ee108ce6b3_2934x1719.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2IXB!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2abfabc4-f54a-4b8e-83ff-29ee108ce6b3_2934x1719.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2IXB!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2abfabc4-f54a-4b8e-83ff-29ee108ce6b3_2934x1719.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2IXB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2abfabc4-f54a-4b8e-83ff-29ee108ce6b3_2934x1719.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><em>(Photo by Paul)</em></figcaption></figure></div><p>But I couldn&#8217;t find a way to integrate that into a larger concept that really communicated the &#8220;IC&#8221;/&#8220;I see&#8221; connection. So today I&#8217;m issuing a call for entries: Let&#8217;s come up with an Inconspicuous Consumption graphic that riffs on the connection between &#8220;IC&#8221; and &#8220;I see.&#8221;</p></div><p>I received lots of submissions (thank you!), but one of them immediately stood out as the best. Behold:</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YF93!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F48e1867a-3f77-47dd-bb46-bca14f1bfecb_2048x1774.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YF93!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F48e1867a-3f77-47dd-bb46-bca14f1bfecb_2048x1774.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YF93!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F48e1867a-3f77-47dd-bb46-bca14f1bfecb_2048x1774.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YF93!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F48e1867a-3f77-47dd-bb46-bca14f1bfecb_2048x1774.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YF93!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F48e1867a-3f77-47dd-bb46-bca14f1bfecb_2048x1774.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YF93!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F48e1867a-3f77-47dd-bb46-bca14f1bfecb_2048x1774.jpeg" width="503" height="435.63392857142856" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/48e1867a-3f77-47dd-bb46-bca14f1bfecb_2048x1774.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1261,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:503,&quot;bytes&quot;:332398,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.inconspicuous.info/i/208509840?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F48e1867a-3f77-47dd-bb46-bca14f1bfecb_2048x1774.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YF93!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F48e1867a-3f77-47dd-bb46-bca14f1bfecb_2048x1774.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YF93!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F48e1867a-3f77-47dd-bb46-bca14f1bfecb_2048x1774.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YF93!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F48e1867a-3f77-47dd-bb46-bca14f1bfecb_2048x1774.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YF93!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F48e1867a-3f77-47dd-bb46-bca14f1bfecb_2048x1774.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Isn&#8217;t that great? It&#8217;s from IC reader Jonathan Lawrence, a professional graphic designer based in Atlanta, and I <em>love</em> it &#8212; so simple, so playful, and it really gets at the connection between &#8220;IC&#8221; and &#8220;I see.&#8221; Plus it feels rooted in classic graphic design history, because reminds me of Paul Rand&#8217;s famous <a href="https://www.logodesignlove.com/images/books/paul-rand-designers-art-02.jpg">IBM rebus</a> and also echoes all the great <a href="https://www.google.com/search?q=eyes+of+bauhaus&amp;sca_esv=0eb4af0c9f494922&amp;biw=1513&amp;bih=821&amp;udm=2&amp;sxsrf=APpeQnsY24WVn_OiVgGBlnRpCD6424FLYw%3A1785098501641&amp;ei=BXFmauuiJseg5NoP2c202AM&amp;ved=0ahUKEwirudCQmvGVAxVHEFkFHdkmDTsQ4dUDCBE&amp;uact=5&amp;oq=eyes+of+bauhaus&amp;gs_lp=Egtnd3Mtd2l6LWltZyIPZXllcyBvZiBiYXVoYXVzSKIIUN0EWN0EcAJ4AJABAJgBWKABWKoBATG4AQPIAQD4AQGYAgCgAgCYAwCIBgGSBwCgBwyyBwC4BwDCBwDIBwCACAE&amp;sclient=gws-wiz-img">eyeball-themed Bauhaus posters</a>.</p><p>I told Jonathan that I thought it would be fun to have other eye colors available, so he added brown and green to the mix:</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NfI6!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7deb911f-da8b-461e-9569-94a629b1dcea_1932x848.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NfI6!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7deb911f-da8b-461e-9569-94a629b1dcea_1932x848.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NfI6!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7deb911f-da8b-461e-9569-94a629b1dcea_1932x848.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NfI6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7deb911f-da8b-461e-9569-94a629b1dcea_1932x848.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NfI6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7deb911f-da8b-461e-9569-94a629b1dcea_1932x848.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NfI6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fp