eset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>These light-colored shirts, with the black &#8220;IC&#8221; lettering, are available in a bunch of colors and styles, depending on the eye color. Here&#8217;s a sampling:</p><div class="image-gallery-embed" data-attrs="{&quot;gallery&quot;:{&quot;images&quot;:[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/avif&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5a15e46d-3827-47ec-8ada-bdd0ff347e34_2048x2048.avif&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/avif&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b1600de3-6a08-459d-b2da-6fd30fcfadbe_2048x2048.avif&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/avif&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4de764e8-b493-4c72-a705-ef03e3a1be85_2048x2048.avif&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/avif&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c4080fc7-1523-4d0d-aad3-3746e69ac61a_2048x2048.avif&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/avif&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c825994b-1b88-4048-bd03-3e54dc359ccf_2048x2048.avif&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/avif&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b9e0c730-1cdc-4e48-8eed-d7168c473442_2048x2048.avif&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/avif&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/53da50dc-725c-4dae-b670-bb62042b3de8_2048x2048.avif&quot;}],&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;staticGalleryImage&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/bbc3c801-eb22-42af-8b07-ba1be7982e58_1456x1946.png&quot;}},&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true}"></div><p>For darker shirt colors, we have the &#8220;IC&#8221; lettering in white &#8212; again, with all three eye colors available. Here&#8217;s a sampling of those designs:</p><div class="image-gallery-embed" data-attrs="{&quot;gallery&quot;:{&quot;images&quot;:[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/avif&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5b045dc0-33d2-412a-886e-54b401902595_2048x2048.avif&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/avif&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4142aa9a-1ce6-48ce-a8d0-a0c0365c5342_2048x2048.avif&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/avif&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a8039a2e-f14a-4d25-b5ad-d14bcc84f565_2048x2048.avif&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/avif&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c9fb8f27-9707-4844-ba58-72192a5fdd03_2048x2048.avif&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/avif&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/cd0e1f2c-8eb2-4d92-bfab-38f731a2c621_2048x2048.avif&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/avif&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/0f6ee5d5-c263-49b8-9044-e0503a672a5c_2048x2048.avif&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/avif&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c45f499d-6df4-4d44-a750-a42731b7735b_2048x2048.avif&quot;}],&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;staticGalleryImage&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a4f38ece-cd97-46be-91d1-f5561104e080_1456x1946.png&quot;}},&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true}"></div><p>I realize that it can look a bit odd for the &#8220;whites&#8221; of the eyes to be black, navy, brown, or whatever the shirt color happens to be. Jonathan and I played around with various ways of making that part of the eyeball white, regardless of the shirt color, but we agreed that those solutions all made the eye feel less naturalistic within the &#8220;C,&#8221; so we ultimately decided to let the shirt color serve as the &#8220;whites&#8221; of the eyes. (Of course, you can solve this issue by getting white or off-white as your shirt color.)</p><p>We also considered putting &#8220;Inconspicuous Consumption&#8221; on the back of the shirt &#8212; sort of an answer key to the inevitable &#8220;What does &#8216;IC&#8217; stand for?&#8221; query &#8212; but that would have raised the shirt price by at least $4, plus we kinda like the idea of letting the logo speak for itself. If you know, you know; if you don&#8217;t know, maybe you&#8217;ll ask and find out!</p><p>So there are six separate versions of the shirt (each with multiple color and style options). Here are the ordering pages for each of them: </p><ul><li><p><a href="https://cottonbureau.com/p/M9QZU3/shirt/i-see-black-type-blue-eye#/35746372/tee-men-premium-heavyweight-ivory-100percent-cotton-s">Black letting, blue eye</a></p></li><li><p><a href="https://cottonbureau.com/p/JWXVVZ/shirt/i-see-black-type-brown-eye#/35746710/tee-men-premium-heavyweight-ivory-100percent-cotton-s">Black lettering, brown eye</a></p></li><li><p><a href="https://cottonbureau.com/p/RRCHRN/shirt/i-see-black-type-green-eye">Black lettering, green eye</a></p></li><li><p><a href="https://cottonbureau.com/p/MCSPS2/shirt/i-see-white-type-blue-eye">White lettering, blue eye</a></p></li><li><p><a href="https://cottonbureau.com/p/UDN86K/shirt/i-see-white-type-brown-eye">White lettering, brown eye</a></p></li><li><p><a href="https://cottonbureau.com/p/NCADMK/shirt/i-see-white-type-green-eye">White lettering, green eye</a></p></li></ul><p>If you&#8217;re interested in a combination of lettering color, shirt color, and eye color that you don&#8217;t see listed, <a href="mailto:plukas64@gmail.com">let me know</a> and I&#8217;ll try to set it up for you.</p><p>I&#8217;ve also used put the new logo on coffee mugs &#8212; again, in all three eye colors:</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!usGR!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f42d5a4-b0b2-4693-9f90-f72615dd7f95_2176x672.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!usGR!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f42d5a4-b0b2-4693-9f90-f72615dd7f95_2176x672.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!usGR!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f42d5a4-b0b2-4693-9f90-f72615dd7f95_2176x672.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!usGR!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f42d5a4-b0b2-4693-9f90-f72615dd7f95_2176x672.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!usGR!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f42d5a4-b0b2-4693-9f90-f72615dd7f95_2176x672.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!usGR!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f42d5a4-b0b2-4693-9f90-f72615dd7f95_2176x672.png" width="680" height="210.16483516483515" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/7f42d5a4-b0b2-4693-9f90-f72615dd7f95_2176x672.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:680,&quot;bytes&quot;:547380,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.inconspicuous.info/i/208509840?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f42d5a4-b0b2-4693-9f90-f72615dd7f95_2176x672.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!usGR!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f42d5a4-b0b2-4693-9f90-f72615dd7f95_2176x672.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!usGR!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f42d5a4-b0b2-4693-9f90-f72615dd7f95_2176x672.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!usGR!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f42d5a4-b0b2-4693-9f90-f72615dd7f95_2176x672.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!usGR!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7f42d5a4-b0b2-4693-9f90-f72615dd7f95_2176x672.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>And since coffee mugs are white, the whites of the eyes are also white! Here are the ordering pages for the coffee mugs, broken down by eye color: <a href="https://cottonbureau.com/p/9J2VH6/drinkware/i-see-mug-blue">blue</a>, <a href="https://cottonbureau.com/p/BSGWVE/drinkware/i-see-mug-brown">brown</a>, and <a href="https://cottonbureau.com/p/4263PK/drinkware/i-see-mug-green">green</a>.</p><p>I may end up using the &#8220;IC&#8221; mark in additional contexts &#8212; we&#8217;ll see.</p><p>I&#8217;m super-thankful to Jonathan Lawrence for coming up with this great design, and for working with me to refine it. As he explained to me, &#8220;I&#8217;ve <span>always been a graphic designer but didn&#8217;t always know that&#8217;s what it was called. Looking back, my fascinations with color, packaging, and letterforms all make so much sense.&#8221; </span>You can learn more about him <a href="https://jonathanlawrence.net/">on his website</a>, and fans of vintage typography should definitely check out his fantastic <a href="https://typehunting.com/">Typehunting</a><span> site.</span></p><p>Jonathan also tells me he spent a lot of time during his childhood drawing logos for imaginary sports teams, so we may be seeing more of him <a href="https://uniwatch.substack.com/">over on Uni Watch</a>. Stay tuned.</p><div class="subscription-widget-wra