ps%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd9a7009b-cbdb-4727-adbb-a3038b841214_1840x115.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div></div></div></a></figure></div><h2>Big Brannock News</h2><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GCNg!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F73135636-ef90-4bc6-8fd2-d9695ea45cfb_600x600.webp" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GCNg!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F73135636-ef90-4bc6-8fd2-d9695ea45cfb_600x600.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GCNg!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F73135636-ef90-4bc6-8fd2-d9695ea45cfb_600x600.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GCNg!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F73135636-ef90-4bc6-8fd2-d9695ea45cfb_600x600.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GCNg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F73135636-ef90-4bc6-8fd2-d9695ea45cfb_600x600.webp 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GCNg!,w_2400,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F73135636-ef90-4bc6-8fd2-d9695ea45cfb_600x600.webp" width="726" height="726" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/73135636-ef90-4bc6-8fd2-d9695ea45cfb_600x600.webp&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:false,&quot;imageSize&quot;:&quot;large&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:600,&quot;width&quot;:600,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:726,&quot;bytes&quot;:22900,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/webp&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.inconspicuous.info/i/208509840?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F73135636-ef90-4bc6-8fd2-d9695ea45cfb_600x600.webp&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-large" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GCNg!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F73135636-ef90-4bc6-8fd2-d9695ea45cfb_600x600.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GCNg!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F73135636-ef90-4bc6-8fd2-d9695ea45cfb_600x600.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GCNg!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F73135636-ef90-4bc6-8fd2-d9695ea45cfb_600x600.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GCNg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F73135636-ef90-4bc6-8fd2-d9695ea45cfb_600x600.webp 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><em>(Graphic from 99percentinvisible.org)</em></figcaption></figure></div><p>The great design podcast <em><span>99% Invisible</span></em> recently launched a project called &#8220;A History of the United States in 100 Objects.&#8221; Happily, they had the wisdom to include the eternal <span>Brannock Device</span> as one of the 100 objects profiled in the series. As a longtime Brannock evangelist, I was excited and honored to be interviewed at length for this episode, much of which is basically a conversation between myself and <em>99PI</em> host/founder Roman Mars. The whole process was a blast.</p><p>The episode is <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/100-objects-11-brannock-device/id394775318?i=1000775840103">now available to SiriusXM subscribers</a>, and it will go public for everyone else on Friday. I hope you&#8217;ll check it out!</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2_Wc!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39b9d0d1-f199-4592-bfd1-2f575e870191_1824x128.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2_Wc!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39b9d0d1-f199-4592-bfd1-2f575e870191_1824x128.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2_Wc!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39b9d0d1-f199-4592-bfd1-2f575e870191_1824x128.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2_Wc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39b9d0d1-f199-4592-bfd1-2f575e870191_1824x128.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2_Wc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39b9d0d1-f199-4592-bfd1-2f575e870191_1824x128.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2_Wc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39b9d0d1-f199-4592-bfd1-2f575e870191_1824x128.png" width="596" height="41.752747252747255" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/39b9d0d1-f199-4592-bfd1-2f575e870191_1824x128.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:102,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:596,&quot;bytes&quot;:24456,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.inconspicuous.info/i/208509840?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39b9d0d1-f199-4592-bfd1-2f575e870191_1824x128.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2_Wc!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39b9d0d1-f199-4592-bfd1-2f575e870191_1824x128.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2_Wc!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39b9d0d1-f199-4592-bfd1-2f575e870191_1824x128.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2_Wc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39b9d0d1-f199-4592-bfd1-2f575e870191_1824x128.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2_Wc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39b9d0d1-f199-4592-bfd1-2f575e870191_1824x128.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div></div></div></a></figure></div><h2>A Special Interaction</h2><p>I recently posted a link to a bunch of stuff I&#8217;m <a href="https://www.ebay.com/usr/beerframeguy">selling on eBay</a>. One of those items &#8212;a <a href="https://www.ebay.com/itm/256960630784">vintage price sign for horse meat</a> from a French butcher shop &#8212; sold a few days after I posted the link, and the buyer sent me a very sweet note after making the purchase:</p><blockquote><p>Hi Paul,</p><p>I bought the horse meat sign because I shoplifted your book in 1997 when I was a teenage clerk at Waldenbooks. I&#8217;m sorry.</p><p>Unfortunately, I went on to study the liberal arts and am thus unable to calculate the appropriate compound interest to make you whole in this case. I hope this purchase provides some small compensation and closure for us both and that we are able to move forward in a spirit of reconciliation.</p><p>In all seriousness, thank you for the many inconspicuous marvels you&#8217;ve helped me notice these past 30 years. My wife plans to use the sign at dinner parties.</p><p>Best,<br>[name redacted]</p></blockquote><p>Isn&#8217;t that great? It&#8217;s worth noting that the real victim of the book theft was not me but the bookstore &#8212; in this case, Waldenbooks. They went bankrupt <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waldenbooks">in 2011</a>, and now we know why.</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.inconspicuous.info/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://www.inconspicuous.info/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Paul Lukas has been obsessing over the inconspicuous for most of his life, and has been writing about those obsessions for more than 30 years. He also writes <a href="https://uniwatch.substack.com/">Uni Watch</a>, which is sort of like Inconspicuous Consumption for sports. You can <a href="mailto:plukas64@gmail.com">contact him here</a>.</em></p>]]></content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[The Scourge of Inconsistent Street Sign Lettering]]></title><description><![CDATA[A reader takes us on a guided tour of his hometown&#8217;s inexplicably erratic street signs. Plus a new Inconspicuous News Roundup, and more!]]></description><link>https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/the-scourge-of-inconsistent-street</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/the-scourge-of-inconsistent-street</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Norb]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 12:05:31 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3b46ac3