,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:123206,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.inconspicuous.info/i/208152786?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51336f60-fdef-49f7-8759-ebc6dc464933_1970x1230.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jFQt!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51336f60-fdef-49f7-8759-ebc6dc464933_1970x1230.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jFQt!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51336f60-fdef-49f7-8759-ebc6dc464933_1970x1230.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jFQt!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51336f60-fdef-49f7-8759-ebc6dc464933_1970x1230.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jFQt!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51336f60-fdef-49f7-8759-ebc6dc464933_1970x1230.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><em>(Graphic by Paul)</em></figcaption></figure></div><p><em><strong>Note: </strong>Inconspicuous Consumption reader Norb Rozek recently posted on social media about the street signs in his hometown of Green Bay, Wisconsin. His manifesto was so squarely in the IC wheelhouse that I asked him if we could adapt it into a guest-written IC post, and he graciously agreed.</em></p><p><em>This post is not paywalled. Enjoy! &#8212; Paul</em></p><div><hr></div><p><em>By Norb Rozek</em></p><p><span>Slipshod street signs have long been a source of annoyance for me. I think this might stem from when I was four and we moved to a suburb where a street not  far from ours had signs that variously read &#8220;Kalb Street,&#8221; &#8220;Kolb Street,&#8221; and &#8220;Colb Street.&#8221; This street was maybe a mile long. How exactly can one wind up with three different spellings of the same street name? How do the signs get left like that? Does nobody notice? Does nobody care? Seemed weird to me, even as a little kid.</span></p><p><span>I now live in Green Bay, Wisconsin, which has the most pathetic excuses for street signs of any city I&#8217;ve ever been to, and I&#8217;ve been to quite a few. There&#8217;s no standardization, no quality control, no attempt whatsoever to pretend that anyone really cares &#8212; just a bizarre mish-mosh of whatever letters were lying around that day, I guess.</span></p><p>In an attempt to document this sorry phenomenon, I recently walked down a roughly half-mile stretch of Washington St., a major artery that runs through downtown. Here&#8217;s a map of the span I traversed:</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d_w5!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdc957014-3873-4c2c-8dc7-9f8cbacf682c_972x1186.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d_w5!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdc957014-3873-4c2c-8dc7-9f8cbacf682c_972x1186.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d_w5!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdc957014-3873-4c2c-8dc7-9f8cbacf682c_972x1186.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d_w5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdc957014-3873-4c2c-8dc7-9f8cbacf682c_972x1186.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d_w5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdc957014-3873-4c2c-8dc7-9f8cbacf682c_972x1186.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d_w5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s