roke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><em>(Photo by Norb Rozek)</em></figcaption></figure></div><p><span>This is </span><em><span>almost</span></em><span> a match with our first sign at Washington and Main &#8212; except that first sign had &#8220;Washington&#8221; in Franklin Gothic Heavy </span><em><span>Condensed</span></em><span>, and here it&#8217;s just regular Franklin Gothic Heavy. As Maxwell Smart used to say, &#8220;Missed it by </span><em><span>that</span></em><span> much!&#8221;</span></p><p><span>A block down from that, we come to&#8230;</span></p><h3>South Washington St. and Admiral Flatley Ct.</h3><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VfzU!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F10ef29d9-4535-47c7-9172-45d45ca3ef4d_2048x1584.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VfzU!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F10ef29d9-4535-47c7-9172-45d45ca3ef4d_2048x1584.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VfzU!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F10ef29d9-4535-47c7-9172-45d45ca3ef4d_2048x1584.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VfzU!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F10ef29d9-4535-47c7-9172-45d45ca3ef4d_2048x1584.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VfzU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F10ef29d9-4535-47c7-9172-45d45ca3ef4d_2048x1584.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VfzU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F10ef29d9-4535-47c7-9172-45d45ca3ef4d_2048x1584.jpeg" width="1456" height="1126" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/10ef29d9-4535-47c7-9172-45d45ca3ef4d_2048x1584.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1126,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:259471,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.inconspicuous.info/i/208152786?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F10ef29d9-4535-47c7-9172-45d45ca3ef4d_2048x1584.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VfzU!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F10ef29d9-4535-47c7-9172-45d45ca3ef4d_2048x1584.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VfzU!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F10ef29d9-4535-47c7-9172-45d45ca3ef4d_2048x1584.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VfzU!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F10ef29d9-4535-47c7-9172-45d45ca3ef4d_2048x1584.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VfzU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F10ef29d9-4535-47c7-9172-45d45ca3ef4d_2048x1584.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><em>(Photo by Norb Rozek)</em></figcaption></figure></div><p><span>&#8220;Washington&#8221; has reverted to Franklin Gothic regular, while &#8220;Adm. Flatley&#8221; is in Franklin Gothic Heavy. I stopped after that because I got bored documenting the carnage.</span></p><p><span>Just to be clear, I wasn&#8217;t combing through all of downtown to find boo-boos or inconsistencies in the street signs. THESE ARE NINE INTERSECTIONS IN A ROW, ON A MAIN THOROUGHFARE, THAT I HAPPENED TO WALK PAST, AND NONE OF THEIR SIGNS MATCH. If I live to be a million, I will never understand how grown adults sign off on such slop. Who okayed this?</span></p><div><hr></div><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/the-scourge-of-inconsistent-street?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/the-scourge-of-inconsistent-street?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share"><span>Share</span></a></p><p>Paul here. Big thanks to Norb for his eagle eye and uncompromising typographic rigor. Here&#8217;s a gallery of all nine of his sign pics, just so you can see them all at once (you can click on the images to enlarge):</p><div class="image-gallery-embed" data-attrs="{&quot;gallery&quot;:{&quot;images&quot;:[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/343d4db7-46dc-4257-8c1f-3e186908a80a_2048x1554.jpeg&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/13b7881a-69ab-4be7-a136-32700fa14b87_2048x1171.jpeg&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2ddb8922-3fb1-497d-b7e9-da0e52a492f0_1565x1201.jpeg&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/996eee37-b9e8-4ccb-badd-5c2a188c4a4d_2048x1499.jpeg&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5f730c4f-901b-4ecf-9224-5360a48f80bd_2048x1591.jpeg&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e6f7ab4e-b7b6-4e6e-aedd-8f0ffc7f713e_1355x884.jpeg&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2fc31caf-b192-4967-8f16-2490591891e5_2048x1071.jpeg&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/cf16460e-04fa-4258-808f-9c2e8c950fe3_2048x1038.jpeg&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8f55b020-8f4a-40ea-9c1c-e0db1446e05d_2048x1584.jpeg&quot;}],&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;(Photos by Norb Rozek)&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;staticGalleryImage&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/889ba263-e87b-48cb-8af9-49f0767ebac1_1456x1454.png&quot;}},&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true}"></div><p>All kidding aside, most municipalities have style guides to cover this sort of thing. And while changing graphics standards occasionally lead to a certain degree of inconsistency (many cities, including mine, have slowly been replacing all-caps signs with title case, for example), Green Bay&#8217;s lack of uniformity does seem a bit extreme.</p><p>Oh, and I should add that what Norb refers to as &#8220;Street Sign font&#8221; is actually <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highway_Gothic">Highway Gothic</a>. I didn&#8217;t change it in his text because I thought his nomenclature was amusing.</p><p>An appreciation for the finer points of street signage runs in Norb&#8217;s family. As you may recall, his brother, Kurt Rozek, was a longtime employee of the Street Department in the Green Bay suburb of Allouez. He recently retired, but shortly before that he spotted a new street sign that was due to be installed but was missing the dot over an &#8220;i&#8221; (sometimes referred to as a <em><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tittle">tittle</a></em>), so he used some reflective tape <a href="https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/remembering-to-dot-every-i-literally">to create a DIY dot</a> for the sign. The tape he used was silver while the rest of the sign lettering was white, creating an endearingly inconspicuous anomaly.</p><p>Kurt didn&#8217;t remain on the job long enough to see his DIY-dotted sign installed on the street, but he recently had a dental appointment in Allouez, so he drove by and saw his silver-dotted sign in the wild:</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Poxn!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9ea5c438-67f3-49ca-9c60-b47b67334488_1456x1092.webp" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Poxn!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9ea5c438-67f3-49ca-9c60-b47b67334488_1456x1092.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Poxn!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9ea5c438-67f3-49ca-9c60-b47b67334488_1456x1092.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Poxn!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9ea5c438-67f3-49ca-9c60-b47b67334488_1456x1092.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Poxn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-