-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vpvR!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff996ee76-c29f-40ef-994d-ca59b456279d_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vpvR!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff996ee76-c29f-40ef-994d-ca59b456279d_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vpvR!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff996ee76-c29f-40ef-994d-ca59b456279d_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vpvR!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff996ee76-c29f-40ef-994d-ca59b456279d_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vpvR!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff996ee76-c29f-40ef-994d-ca59b456279d_4032x3024.jpeg" width="1456" height="1092" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f996ee76-c29f-40ef-994d-ca59b456279d_4032x3024.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1092,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:2903159,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.inconspicuous.info/i/207430861?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff996ee76-c29f-40ef-994d-ca59b456279d_4032x3024.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vpvR!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff996ee76-c29f-40ef-994d-ca59b456279d_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vpvR!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff996ee76-c29f-40ef-994d-ca59b456279d_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vpvR!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff996ee76-c29f-40ef-994d-ca59b456279d_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vpvR!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff996ee76-c29f-40ef-994d-ca59b456279d_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><em>A close-up view of the tittle. (Photo by Kurt Rozek)</em></figcaption></figure></div><p>So even though Kurt no longer works in Allouez, he&#8217;s left his mark on the town &#8212; literally.</p><p>Unless anyone can provide evidence to the contrary, I think we can safely say that the Rozek brothers take the prize for being IC&#8217;s most sign-obsessed siblings. I mentioned this to Norb, who wrote back:</p><blockquote><p>My one experience similar to my brother&#8217;s dotting of the &#8220;i&#8221; was when I had a janitorial gig at an office complex in the &#8217;80s. My boss had had some signs made up that I was supposed to go around affixing. They read &#8220;NO PARKING &#8212; VIOLATORS WILL BE TOWED AT OWNER&#8217;S EXPENCE.&#8221; I was flabbergasted that no one caught &#8220;EXPENCE&#8221; at any step of the process.</p><p>After informing my supervisor of the error, I was told to go put the signs up anyway. My reward for pointing out the spelling mistake was to go back around to all the signs the next day with a bunch of little cover-up &#8220;S&#8221; stickers that they made to fix the problem. I put one of the stickers upside-down as some manner of statement or protest or something. Needless to say, no one caught it.</p></blockquote><p>I will add one last thought here: I am not a fan of municipalities putting their town logo (or tourism logo, or whatever) on the left side of their street signs, as both Green Bay and Allouez have done. I&#8217;m not sure when this trend began, but there&#8217;s something about it that makes the sign feel more promotional than informational. How do you people feel about this?</p><h4>And Speaking of Road Signs&#8230;</h4><p>You may recall that my friend Liz Clayton was visiting family last year in Michigan City, Indiana, and sent us this photo of an <a href="https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/some-very-unusual-traffic-signs">unusually growth-stunted Stop sign</a>, using her four-foot-tall daughter for scale:</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GPtM!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad5947bd-8dce-43c9-805d-b43154e4702a_4284x5712.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GPtM!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad5947bd-8dce-43c9-805d-b43154e4702a_4284x5712.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GPtM!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad5947bd-8dce-43c9-805d-b43154e4702a_4284x5712.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GPtM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad5947bd-8dce-43c9-805d-b43154e4702a_4284x5712.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GPtM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad5947bd-8dce-43c9-805d-b43154e4702a_4284x5712.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GPtM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad5947bd-8dce-43