mage/fetch/$s_!chuN!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6e4ddf14-142a-42f2-b118-eb4088e8df7d_1870x1107.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!chuN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6e4ddf14-142a-42f2-b118-eb4088e8df7d_1870x1107.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><em>(Screen shot from uniwatch.substack.com)</em></figcaption></figure></div><p>I think most of you know this by now, but just in case: I recently announced that the Uni Watch blog will go dark <a href="https://uni-watch.com/">at the end of July</a>, but that will <em>not </em>be the end of Uni Watch, because I&#8217;m moving the operations over to Substack, where I&#8217;ll be posting about uni-related items now and then. You can see my introductory post <a href="https://uniwatch.substack.com/p/welcome-to-uni-watch-on-substack">here</a>. I&#8217;ll be publishing a new article early next week; you can make sure that you see it by <a href="https://uniwatch.substack.com/subscribe">subscribing</a>. (It&#8217;s free for now, but I may be adding a paywall soon-ish.) </p><p>Inconspicuous Consumption is still my main priority, but I&#8217;m happy to keep Uni Watch going, even if at a much slower pace than in the past. Thanks to everyone who&#8217;s already subscribed!</p><p><em>Paul Lukas has been obsessing over the inconspicuous for most of his life, and has been writing about those obsessions for more than 30 years. You can <a href="mailto:plukas64@gmail.com">contact him here</a>.</em></p>]]></content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[The Surprisingly Deep “Sanforized” Rabbit Hole]]></title><description><![CDATA[It&#8217;s a ubiquitous term on old clothing labels. But what does it mean, and why are there so many different versions of it?]]></description><link>https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/the-surprisingly-deep-sanforized</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/the-surprisingly-deep-sanforized</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Paul Lukas]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 12:25:04 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/174703a0-0423-4165-a5ee-2569e4b07934_1963x1104.jpeg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y6yG!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsu