uot;https://www.inconspicuous.info/i/207011153?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F874aa5ee-45e3-4aa3-899e-9c15adfd6251_1886x889.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mO2J!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F874aa5ee-45e3-4aa3-899e-9c15adfd6251_1886x889.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mO2J!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F874aa5ee-45e3-4aa3-899e-9c15adfd6251_1886x889.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mO2J!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F874aa5ee-45e3-4aa3-899e-9c15adfd6251_1886x889.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mO2J!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F874aa5ee-45e3-4aa3-899e-9c15adfd6251_1886x889.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><em>(Photo by Paul)</em></figcaption></figure></div><p>I went through the entire rack. There were 29 shirts, 13 of which were labeled as &#8220;Sanforized&#8221; &#8212; including one that was &#8220;Sanforized Plus&#8221;! Of those 13, 11 had the pair of bullets framing the italic lettering. Here are the remaining examples (you can click the images to see larger versions):</p><div class="image-gallery-embed" data-attrs="{&quot;gallery&quot;:{&quot;images&quot;:[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f34ee568-e08f-41fb-b57a-d5e3aa190131_1860x1118.jpeg&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/41b7f4f1-22d7-4fd3-8a72-7582e0999807_1494x1127.jpeg&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d8de5c07-2f78-4096-8666-a4ca23bcf0b4_1456x1002.jpeg&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/dbaff9df-b487-4199-99e8-be148f03a4d3_1153x990.jpeg&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/517f684e-c30d-4b32-b2b1-18d5d2225b41_1319x1007.jpeg&quot;}],&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;staticGalleryImage&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5f2754a5-abe4-45ee-aa23-a313ed1f814d_1456x1210.png&quot;}},&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true}"></div><div class="image-gallery-embed" data-attrs="{&quot;gallery&quot;:{&quot;images&quot;:[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a4f795db-e985-4ec7-b4a8-44fbe07d68da_1523x1009.jpeg&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6c8d9a40-a869-4b45-b8b5-5f1dd23352ef_1406x863.jpeg&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d6d3411c-00a7-49b1-85f0-52b3e959cd68_824x676.jpeg&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/0b709934-cdfb-4f04-99cc-f831a2ea2050_1731x1054.jpeg&quot;},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/88eaec4c-9be4-4ec6-ab17-e1345dde216e_1048x831.jpeg&quot;}],&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;(Photos by Paul)&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;staticGalleryImage&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/26e71291-e2fc-417e-a260-4dfb615ed968_1456x1210.png&quot;}},&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true}"></div><p>Despite the ubiquity of &#8220;Sanforized,&#8221; I&#8217;d never noticed that the word was essentially a logotype. Moreover, despite being a professionally curious person who&#8217;s spent a lot of time looking at vintage clothing, I suddenly realized that I didn&#8217;t even know what &#8220;Sanforized&#8221; meant! I knew it signified, uh, something fabric-related, but I wasn&#8217;t sure what that something was. This felt like an embarrassing gap in my knowledge &#8212; one that needed to be remedied.</p>
