   ]]></content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[The Colorful Little Road Markers with a Story to Tell]]></title><description><![CDATA[Design is all around us if you know where to look, and right underfoot is a good place to start.]]></description><link>https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/the-colorful-little-road-markers</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/the-colorful-little-road-markers</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Paul Lukas]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 12:29:30 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wqZO!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F758c339f-2ec2-4b89-ad9c-9572609bbce3_1608x856.jpeg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wqZO!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F758c339f-2ec2-4b89-ad9c-9572609bbce3_1608x856.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wqZO!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F758c339f-2ec2-4b89-ad9c-9572609bbce3_1608x856.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wqZO!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F758c339f-2ec2-4b89-ad9c-9572609bbce3_1608x856.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wqZO!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F758c339f-2ec2-4b89-ad9c-9572609bbce3_1608x856.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wqZO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_p