%2Fcbd6b150-8459-4a44-859c-8bfd23603c47_2702x1601.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7yxp!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbd6b150-8459-4a44-859c-8bfd23603c47_2702x1601.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><em>A-tags aren&#8217;t limited to roads. I spotted these two the other day on a pedestrian walkway in Central Park. It&#8217;s a nice juxtaposition, because orange and blue are New York&#8217;s official city colors. (Photo by Paul)</em></figcaption></figure></div><p>A-tags were <a href="https://patentimages.storage.googleapis.com/a2/99/05/a7986c2a05ce41/US5035531.pdf">patented</a> in 1991 (the official invention name on the patent application was &#8220;utility cut patch identification tag&#8221;) and brought to market by a Minnesota-based company called Rhino Markers. Rhino was later acquired by Texas-based Trident Solutions, which <a href="https://www.tridentproducts.com/product/a-tags/">continues to sell A-tags today</a> (as do several other vendors). Tom Preston, a Rhino executive, describes the little markers with a mix of nonchalance and pride. &#8220;You know that little plastic thing that holds up the center of a pizza box? It&#8217;s basically a glorified version of that,&#8221; he says. &#8220;But it&#8217;s been a really good success story &#8212; we solved a problem for New York City.&#8221;</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fpsK!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe364be75-d9a0-44bc-9013-4872ab931dc7_1140x1456.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fpsK!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe364be75-d9a0-44bc-9013-4872ab931dc7_1140x1456.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fpsK!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe364be75-d9a0-44bc-9013-4872ab931dc7_1140x1456.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fpsK!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe364be75-d9a0-44bc-9013-4872ab931dc7_1140x1456.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fpsK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe364be75-d9a0-44bc-9013-4872ab931dc7_1140x1456.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fpsK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe364be75-d9a0-44bc-9013-4872ab931dc7_1140x1456.png" width="478" height="610.4982456140351" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e364be75-d9a0-44bc-9013-4872ab931dc7_1140x1456.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1456,&quot;width&quot;:1140,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:478,&quot;bytes&quot;:219481,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.inconspicuous.info/i/203989447?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe364be75-d9a0-44bc-9013-4872ab931dc7_1140x1456.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fpsK!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe364be75-d9a0-44bc-9013-4872ab931dc7_1140x1456.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fpsK!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe364be75-d9a0-44bc-9013-4872ab931dc7_1140x1456.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fpsK!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe364be75-d9a0-44bc-9013-4872ab931dc7_1140x1456.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fpsK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe364be75-d9a0-44bc-9013-4872ab931dc7_1140x1456.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><em>The original patent drawings for the A-tag. (Image via U.S. Patent and Trademark Office)</em></figcaption></figure></div><p>Indeed, New York&#8217;s A-tag experience has been so positive that Boston officials started a similar program for their own streets in 2011. &#8220;It started when the mayor at the time [Thomas Menino] drove over a patch that had settled, and he wanted it fixed,&#8221; says Mark Cardarelli, Supervisor of Utility Coordination and Compliance at the Boston Public Works Department. &#8220;He called our department and we couldn&#8217;t identify who had done the patch. I checked with all the utilities, and they all said, &#8216;It wasn&#8217;t us!&#8217; So I went online and saw that New York City was using these color-coded tags. I gotta give them credit for coming up with that.&#8221;</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2DUf!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1847f729-241b-494c-b962-c9b8b36de881_800x1536.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2DUf!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1847f729-241b-494c-b962-c9b8b36de881_800x1536.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2DUf!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1847f729-241b-494c-b962-c9b8b36de881_800x1536.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2DUf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1847f729-241b-494c-b962-c9b8b36de881_800x1536.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2DUf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1847f729-241b-494c-b962-c9b8b36de881_800x1536.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2DUf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1847f729-241b-494