awS5_UhleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFydjhnOTVUVk1mT1JHWkd5c3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHn1bErzPlKOL14h6_zTdgH_X-VJzci3ylq27BQl9lTdUZ3QaJj_enpqCI4_a_aem_ur9EMDWTpLqXiK4lUJX9Lg">really, really good article</a> about the guy who came up with it, and why it was such a key road-safety innovation. IC&#8217;s highest rating! (From Rich Kronenberg)</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>The <a href="https://www.udisglutenfree.com/">logo</a> for Udi&#8217;s, a brand that specializes in gluten-free baked goods, includes a mark that doubles as an apostrophe and the dot above the &#8220;i.&#8221; (From Nathan Haas)</p></li><li><p>Reader David Zwiep briefly got excited when he saw a sign promoting an upcoming &#8220;I.C. Festival,&#8221; but in this case the abbreviation did not stand for &#8220;Inconspicuous Consumption&#8221;:</p></li></ul><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jtlK!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2be17087-7fff-4b3a-a9e2-d63dd5178025_1465x1804.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jtlK!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2be17087-7fff-4b3a-a9e2-d63dd5178025_1465x1804.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jtlK!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2be17087-7fff-4b3a-a9e2-d63dd5178025_1465x1804.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jtlK!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2be17087-7fff-4b3a-a9e2-d63dd5178025_1465x1804.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jtlK!,w_1456,