lic%2Fimages%2F2abfabc4-f54a-4b8e-83ff-29ee108ce6b3_2934x1719.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2IXB!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2abfabc4-f54a-4b8e-83ff-29ee108ce6b3_2934x1719.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2IXB!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2abfabc4-f54a-4b8e-83ff-29ee108ce6b3_2934x1719.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2IXB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2abfabc4-f54a-4b8e-83ff-29ee108ce6b3_2934x1719.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><em>(Photo by Paul)</em></figcaption></figure></div><p>But I couldn&#8217;t find a way to integrate that into a larger concept that really communicated the &#8220;IC&#8221;/&#8220;I see&#8221; connection. The truth is, I&#8217;m not a very good designer.</p><p>But maybe some of you folks are. So today I&#8217;m issuing a call for entries: Let&#8217;s come up with an Inconspicuous Consumption graphic that riffs on the connection between &#8220;IC&#8221; and &#8220;I see.&#8221;</p><p>A few notes for those who want to take on this challenge:</p><ul><li><p>You&#8217;re welcome to run with my eye-dotted &#8220;i&#8221; idea if you like, but that&#8217;s absolutely not required.</p></li><li><p>Your design can include the words &#8220;Inconspicuous Consumption&#8221; or not. Up to you.</p></li><li><p>Similarly, your design can include images of things we&#8217;ve talked about here (Brannock Devices, manicules, zebra boards, etc.), or not. Again, up to you.</p></li><li><p>If you can find a way to use the phrase <em>&#8220;I see,&#8221; said the blind man, as he picked up his hammer and saw</em>, I&#8217;ll be very impressed.</p></li><li><p>If I particularly like your design, I will put it on a T-shirt that I&#8217;ll make available in the <a href="https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/merchandise">IC shop</a>. I&#8217;ll split the sales profits with you 50/50, plus you&#8217;ll get a free T-shirt with your design.</p></li><li><p>This is a design challenge, not a contest. I may end choosing multiple designs for the T-shirt treatment, or just one, or none. Depends on how I like the designs.</p></li><li><p>Please: No AI or AI-assisted designs.</p></li><li><p><a href="mailto:plukas64@gmail.com">Email your design to me</a> by June 25th (that&#8217;s three weeks from today). You can submit as many designs as you like.</p></li></ul><p>I think that covers it, but let me know if you have any additional questions. Thanks, and have fun with your designs!</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mWij!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3d51d6a9-7196-42c0-8c87-8ec77e0953fa_2590x278.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mWij!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3d51d6a9-7196-42c0-8c87-8ec77e0953fa_2590x278.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mWij!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3d51d6a9-7196-42c0-8c87-8ec77e0953fa_2590x278.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mWij!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3d51d6a9-7196-42c0-8c87-8ec77e0953fa_2590x278.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mWij!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3d51d6a9-7196-42c0-8c87-8ec77e0953fa_2590x278.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mWij!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3d51d6a9-7196-42c0-8c87-8ec77e0953fa_2590x278.png" width="476" height="51" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3d51d6a9-7196-42c0-8c87-8ec77e0953fa_2590x278.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quo