   ]]></content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[The Fascinating Story of Juicy Fruit Gum]]></title><description><![CDATA[The unassuming product has had an odd history &#8212; including a key role in the evolution of modern retailing.]]></description><link>https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/the-fascinating-story-of-juicy-fruit</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/the-fascinating-story-of-juicy-fruit</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Paul Lukas]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 12:14:06 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/88666788-c234-4e46-9bc1-860ec6260175_1444x812.jpeg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ecNz!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f4c94b8-8a54-4adf-9180-86764fb70e80_940x1464.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ecNz!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f4c94b8-8a54-4adf-9180-86764fb70e80_940x1464.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ecNz!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f4c94b8-8a54-4adf-9180-86764fb70e80_940x1464.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ecNz!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f4c94b8-8a54-4adf-9180-86764fb70e80_940x1464.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ecNz!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f4c94b8-8a54-4adf-9180-86764fb70e80_940x1464.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ecNz!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f4c94b8-8a54-4adf-9180-86764fb70e80_940x1464.jpeg" width="940" height="1464" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8f4c94b8-8a54-4adf-9180-86764fb70e80_940x1464.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1464,&quot;width&quot;:940,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:307305,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.inconspicuous.info/i/199326539?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f4c94b8-8a54-4adf-9180-86764fb70e80_940x1464.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ecNz!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f4c94b8-8a54-4adf-9180-86764fb70e80_940x1464.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ecNz!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f4c94b8-8a54-4adf-9180-86764fb70e80_940x1464.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ecNz!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f4c94b8-8a54-4adf-9180-86764fb70e80_940x1464.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ecNz!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8f4c94b8-8a54-4adf-9180-86764fb70e80_940x1464.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><em>A partial timeline of Juicy Fruit packaging. (Photo via Sarasota County Historical Society)</em></figcaption></figure></div><p>Yesterday I wrote about how I recently <a href="https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/lost-and-found-the-power-of-a-rediscovered">rediscovered an old Juicy Fruit gum wrapper</a> that I thought I&#8217;d lost about 20 years ago. The wrapper was originally sent to me back in 1996 by friends who thought I&#8217;d be interested in the odd slogan printed on the packaging: &#8220;The Gum With the Fascinating Artificial Flavor.&#8221;</p><p>As it turns out, that slogan is just one small part of a brand history that&#8217;s loaded with surprising details. For example:</p><h4>1. Juicy Fruit was Wrigley&#8217;s first commercial gum.</h4><p>When William Wrigley Jr. went into the gum biz (he had previously sold soap and baking soda), Juicy Fruit was his first commercial product, launching in 1893. Wrigley&#8217;s Spearmint, which has become much more iconic in the marketplace, debuted later that same year. Doublemint followed more than two decades later, in 1914.</p><h4>2. Juicy Fruit&#8217;s key marketing term is &#8220;fascinating.&#8221;</h4><p>As near as I can figure, the earliest use of &#8220;fascinating&#8221; in Juicy Fruit marketing came around 1930, when the phrase &#8220;Fascinating Flavor&#8221; began appearing on the gum&#8217;s packaging. You can see it on the underside of the Juicy Fruit pack shown in this ad:</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y2NL!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa21b1fa1-d045-46db-b08a-ee7e54930cc6_1114x582.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y2NL!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa21b1fa1-d045-46db-b08a-ee7e54930cc6_1114x582.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y2NL!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa21b1fa1-d045-46db-b08a-ee7e54930cc6_1114x582.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y2NL!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa21b1fa1-d045-46db-b08a-ee7e54930cc6_1114x582.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y2NL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa21b1fa1-d045-46db-b08a-ee7e54930cc6_1114x582.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y2NL!,w_2400,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa21b1fa1-d045-46db-b08a-ee7e54930cc6_1114x582.jpeg" width="1200" height="626.9299820466787" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a21b1fa1-d045-46db-b08a-ee7e54930cc6_1114x582.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:false,&quot;imageSize&quot;:&quot;large&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:582,&quot;width&quot;:1114,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;bytes&quot;:262620,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.inconspicuous.info/i/199326539?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa21b1fa1-d045-46db-b08a-ee7e54930cc6_1114x582.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-large" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y2NL!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa21b1fa1-d045-46db-b08a-ee7e54930cc6_1114x582.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y2NL!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa21b1fa1-d045-46db-b08a-ee7e54930cc6_1114x582.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y2NL!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa21b1fa1-d045-46db-b08a-ee7e54930cc6_1114x582.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y2NL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa21b1fa1-d045-46db-b08a-ee7e54930cc6_1114x582.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><em>The elves shown at upper right, whose pointed headwear reference the arrows on Wrigley&#8217;s Spearmint and Doublemint packaging, appeared in lots of Wrigley&#8217;s ads during the first half of the 1900s. (Photo via Pinterest user White Rabbit)</em></figcaption></figure></div><p>The &#8220;Fascinating Flavor&#8221; phrase was soon amended to become &#8220;<em>Has a </em>Fascinating Flavor&#8221; (emphasis mine), as seen in this 1931 ad:</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vOHz!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bdb7f0f-0c81-4bfc-af49-50eb102c336f_1071x1327.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vOHz!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bdb7f0f-0c81-4bfc-af49-50eb102c336f_1071x1327.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vOHz!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bdb7f0f-0c81-4bfc-af49-50eb102c336f_1071x1327.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vOHz!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bdb7f0f-0c81-4bfc-af49-50eb102c336f_1071x1327.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vOHz!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bdb7f0f-0c81-4bfc-af49-50eb102c336f_1071x1327.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vOHz!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9bdb7f0f-0c81-4bfc-af49-50eb102c336f_1071x1327.jpeg" width="544" height="674.031746031746" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9bdb7f0f-0c81-4bfc-af49-50eb102c336f_1071x1327.jpeg&qu