   ]]></content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[Lost and Found: The Power of a Rediscovered Artifact]]></title><description><![CDATA[How an old gum wrapper sent me on a nostalgic reverie. Plus a new Inconspicuous News Roundup!]]></description><link>https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/lost-and-found-the-power-of-a-rediscovered</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/lost-and-found-the-power-of-a-rediscovered</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Paul Lukas]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 12:25:33 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PF2Z!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F188ad3d0-aa1d-450f-b828-567ef9d68974_1966x1194.jpeg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PF2Z!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F188ad3d0-aa1d-450f-b828-567ef9d68974_1966x1194.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PF2Z!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F188ad3d0-aa1d-450f-b828-567ef9d68974_1966x1194.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PF2Z!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F188ad3d0-aa1d-450f-b828-567ef9d68974_1966x1194.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PF2Z!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F188ad3d0-aa1d-450f-b828-567ef9d68974_1966x1194.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PF2Z!,w_1456,c_limit,f_