   ]]></content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[A Very Special, Utterly Enjoyable Piece of Mail]]></title><description><![CDATA[A reader sent me an extremely thoughtful letter. Plus more apostrophic signage and a new Inconspicuous News Roundup!]]></description><link>https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/a-very-special-utterly-enjoyable</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/a-very-special-utterly-enjoyable</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Paul Lukas]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 12:20:48 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kKQg!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34378bba-dd03-443d-a4a1-963c6cfb107a_3714x2193.jpeg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kKQg!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34378bba-dd03-443d-a4a1-963c6cfb107a_3714x2193.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kKQg!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34378bba-dd03-443d-a4a1-963c6cfb107a_3714x2193.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kKQg!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34378bba-dd03-443d-a4a1-963c6cfb107a_3714x2193.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kKQg!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34378bba-dd03-443d-a4a1-963c6cfb107a_3714x2193.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kKQg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34378bba-dd03-443d-a4a1-963c6cfb107a_3714x2193.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kKQg!,w_2400,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34378bba-dd03-443d-a4a1-963c6cfb107a_3714x2193.jpeg" width="1200" height="708.7912087912088" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/34378bba-dd03-443d-a4a1-963c6cfb107a_3714x2193.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:false,&quot;imageSize&quot;:&quot;large&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:860,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;bytes&quot;:2442287,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.inconspicuous.info/i/197791770?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34378bba-dd03-443d-a4a1-963c6cfb107a_3714x2193.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-large" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kKQg!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34378bba-dd03-443d-a4a1-963c6cfb107a_3714x2193.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kKQg!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34378bba-dd03-443d-a4a1-963c6cfb107a_3714x2193.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kKQg!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34378bba-dd03-443d-a4a1-963c6cfb107a_3714x2193.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kKQg!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34378bba-dd03-443d-a4a1-963c6cfb107a_3714x2193.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><em>Such a wonderful communiqu&#233; that I don&#8217;t even mind the misspelling of my city&#8217;s name. (Return address altered to preserve sender&#8217;s privacy; photo by Paul)</em></figcaption></figure></div><p>As most of you know by now, <a href="https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/the-joy-of-mail">I love mail</a>, especially if it comes in a hand-addressed envelope. But while all handwritten mail is good, some dispatches are particularly exceptional. The letter shown above, which I was recently lucky enough to receive, is one such specimen.</p><p>There&#8217;s so much to love here, beginning with the loooong manicule (i.e., a pointing hand), which is a topic we&#8217;ve <a href="https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/a-deep-dive-on-return-to-sender-symbols">previously explored</a> here on IC. Even better, this manicule is left-handed! And of course I love the striped sleeve, complete with ribbed trim on the cuff.</p><p>If we zoom in, you can see that the sender used stamps that are actually celebrating the U.S. Postal Service! In other words, this is mail that&#8217;s about mail &#8212; perfect for a postal enthusiast like me.</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXQD!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dca4908-3047-44d2-8f30-317e9af6cbf0_1109x770.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXQD!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dca4908-3047-44d2-8f30-317e9af6cbf0_1109x770.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXQD!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dca4908-3047-44d2-8f30-317e9af6cbf0_1109x770.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXQD!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dca4908-3047-44d2-8f30-317e9af6cbf0_1109x770.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXQD!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dca4908-3047-44d2-8f30-317e9af6cbf0_1109x770.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXQD!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dca4908-3047-44d2-8f30-317e9af6cbf0_1109x770.jpeg" width="721" height="500.60414788097387" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3dca4908-3047-44d2-8f30-317e9af6cbf0_1109x770.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:770,&quot;width&quot;:1109,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:721,&quot;bytes&quot;:344759,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.inconspicuous.info/i/197791770?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dca4908-3047-44d2-8f30-317e9af6cbf0_1109x770.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXQD!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dca4908-3047-44d2-8f30-317e9af6cbf0_1109x770.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXQD!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dca4908-3047-44d2-8f30-317e9af6cbf0_1109x770.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXQD!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dca4908-3047-44d2-8f30-317e9af6cbf0_1109x770.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXQD!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3dca4908-3047-44d2-8f30-317e9af6cbf0_1109x770.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><em>The stamps are from a sheet called &#8220;<a href="https://store.usps.com/store/product/250-years-of-delivering-stamps-S_487104">250 Years of Delivering</a>,&#8221; which was issued last summer. Artwork by the great cartoonist Chris Ware. (Photo by Paul)</em></figcaption></figure></div><p>If we shift our focus from the upper-right corner to the upper-left, something remarkable becomes apparent: The return address, which appears to be a rubber stamp based on handwritten lettering, includes an upside-down &#8220;N,&#8221;<em> </em>which is another topic that&#8217;s been <a href="https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/theres-an-epidemic-of-upside-down">covered here on IC</a>!</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jhn-!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6353827d-d015-4afc-a9df-9d7e1e2759b9_789x538.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jhn-!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6353827d-d015-4afc-a9df-9d7e1e2759b9_789x538.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jhn-!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6353827d-d015-4afc-a9df-9d7e1e2759b9_789x538.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jhn-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6353827d-d015-4afc-a9df-9d7e1e2759b9_789x538.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jhn-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6353827d-d015-4afc-a9df-9d7e1e2759b9_789x538.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jhn-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6353827d-d015-4afc-a9df-9d7e1e2759b9_789x538.jpeg" width="698" height="475.9493029150824" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6353827d-d015-4afc-a