   ]]></content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[In Which I Attend a Matchbook Collectors’ Event]]></title><description><![CDATA[Hanging out with a bunch of phillumenists turned out to be surprising on several levels. Plus more apostrophic signage!]]></description><link>https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/in-which-i-attend-a-matchbook-collectors</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.inconspicuous.info/p/in-which-i-attend-a-matchbook-collectors</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Paul Lukas]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 12:35:40 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2cc12a86-3783-4075-9965-a51fd3d4e614_3793x2251.jpeg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DNRv!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5c6539c7-c8f8-4b02-aa75-40abd0193250_4032x3024.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DNRv!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5c6539c7-c8f8-4b02-aa75-40abd0193250_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DNRv!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5c6539c7-c8f8-4b02-aa75-40abd0193250_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DNRv!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5c6539c7-c8f8-4b02-aa75-40abd0193250_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DNRv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazon